   "title": "Hardware",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "MiniMax H3 at 768 \u00d7 432 for 243 frames wants an NVIDIA card with 24 GB of VRAM or more and about 40\u201360 GB of model files; a window takes 20 to 45 minutes. The graph opens in Comfy Cloud for reading; running it there is a paid, long job."
   ],
   "color": "#3b3b2e",
   "bgcolor": "#5a5a3a"
  },
